            </note>
            <note corresp="#d335-f2" n="1" xml:id="d335-f2-content">
                <p>On May 4 USIA Deputy Director Wilson sent Bundy a memorandum advocating making a
                    statement and attaching a proposed one. (<hi rendition="#italic">Ibid</hi>.) See
                    the Supplement.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
